From: Neena Busireddy <neenareddy.busireddy@nxp.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Sep 2025 15:35:58 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] cmake: Update cmake_minimum_required to 3.5

CMake 4 removed compatibility with versions before 3.5:

| CMake Error at src-ILUT/CMakeLists.txt:1 (cmake_minimum_required):
|   Compatibility with CMake < 3.5 has been removed from CMake.

Raise the minimum in all four CMakeLists.txt files. Taken from meta-imx
LF6.18.37_2.1.0 (YOCIMX-9348), which carries the change without a
patch header.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Rodrigo M. Duarte <rodrigo.duarte@ossystems.com.br>
---
diff -Naur DevIL_org/CMakeLists.txt DevIL/CMakeLists.txt
--- DevIL_org/CMakeLists.txt	2025-09-24 15:30:30.245865820 -0500
+++ DevIL/CMakeLists.txt	2025-09-24 15:30:44.000000000 -0500
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 2.6)
+cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.5)
 
 project(ImageLib)
 
diff -Naur DevIL_org/src-IL/CMakeLists.txt DevIL/src-IL/CMakeLists.txt
--- DevIL_org/src-IL/CMakeLists.txt	2025-09-24 15:30:30.253865862 -0500
+++ DevIL/src-IL/CMakeLists.txt	2025-09-24 15:30:55.000000000 -0500
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 2.6)
+cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.5)
 
 project(DevIL)
 
diff -Naur DevIL_org/src-ILU/CMakeLists.txt DevIL/src-ILU/CMakeLists.txt
--- DevIL_org/src-ILU/CMakeLists.txt	2025-09-24 15:30:30.251865851 -0500
+++ DevIL/src-ILU/CMakeLists.txt	2025-09-24 15:31:05.000000000 -0500
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 2.6)
+cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.5)
 
 project(ILU)
 
diff -Naur DevIL_org/src-ILUT/CMakeLists.txt DevIL/src-ILUT/CMakeLists.txt
--- DevIL_org/src-ILUT/CMakeLists.txt	2025-09-24 15:30:30.249865841 -0500
+++ DevIL/src-ILUT/CMakeLists.txt	2025-09-24 15:31:18.000000000 -0500
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 2.6)
+cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.5)
 
 project(ILUT)
 
